{
  "about": "A token endpoint with a trailing slash, a query or padding loads; Pulse for VS Code keeps it as the CLI keeps an OAuth endpoint, trimmed and otherwise as written, and the CLI refuses a Camunda 8 profile only when it is used.",
  "file": {
    "profiles": {
